12. diŋir sag₉-ga dag-gi₄-a-ka-ni
#lem: diŋir[deity]; sag[good]; daggi[city quarter]
#tr.en: She is the fair goddess of her city-quarter. 
#etcsl: line-id=12

13. ud tur-ra-ni-ta nam-ma-ni tar-ra-am₃
#lem: ud[sun]; tur[small]; nam[fate]; tar[cut]
#tr.en: Her fate has been decided since the days of her youth. 
#etcsl: line-id=13

